      ":question/problem": "![](images/ae/ae67cb7175f220bd35b8b6508542c39850ee9c8bf0143496995466b5dc96e126.png)\n\nIn the diagram, $J$ lies on the segment $AD$. The given vectors are $\\overrightarrow{OA}=t$ and $\\overrightarrow{OD}=v$. The lengths satisfy $AJ:JD=7:1$.\n\nExpress $\\overrightarrow{OJ}$ in terms of $t$ and $v$.",
